        <TABLE align=center width=80%>
          <TR> 
            <TD><b><font size=4>07/20/2001</font></b> </TD>
          </TR>
          <TR> 
            <TD><font size="3"><b>
<font size=10 color=blue> 
			<br>
	
Moving Onward! 
			<br>
	
</font> 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Lets see whats been going on.... ummmm 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Kedge raid! This should have been a complete disaster.. One raid group arrives right before we are ready to go in, then it is determined that we don't have any experienced pullers, and then we find out we really have no one with any experience. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
End result was... we joined with Sentinals of Tunare who waited patiently while we stumbled along slaughtering everything in our path. There is nothing that will wake you up faster then stumbling onto Estrella with all her guards.  
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
She dead! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Phinny also fell as did all his gaurdians. Loot was horrible. Phinny dropped some shaman thing that rotted as there were no shamans. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
He dead! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Then ummmmm something happened...... 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
We dead! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Well after the cleanup was done people were tired and the raid ended. We will be returning soon. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Thanks to Medad and all his mates in AG, as well as the fine people in Alet-Seldi for an enjoyable evening. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
The Hole: Part V 
			<br>
	
For those of you missing out on our Hole exp groups..... Pffffft. 
			<br>
	
Experience has been fast and furious and in last nights groups both Melba and Hanty had the pleasure of hearing the magical "Ding". Good loot also. Singollo's pulling was exceptional.  
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Well thats it for now.
</b></font></TD>
