          <TR> 
            <TD><font size="3"><b>
<font size=12 color=blue> 
			<br>
	
Remains relocated! Luie moves forward! 
			<br>
	
</font> 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Early this AM while we were tucked in our beds Aquinas located Venrils remains. Not much info to give but apparently he won an epic battle and gained his epic stone! Rumors abound of a ranger kiting Venril Sather at the zone.. but right now they are just rumors:P 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Also after much abuse at the hands of Maligar we finally found someone that was well liked by the nasty necro... alas it was Singollo. Upon his arrival we wiped out Maligar's minions and Luie was successful in getting Maligars head. Although it was not as glamourous as killing a huge frog...it was fun:) Luie will have completed his first page enroute to his epic weapon! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Also... Welcome Ceeorn and Darrius!!! Ceeorn was invited tonight and is a worthy cleric. Darrius was invited last night and I was too lazy to post it. He is a wizzy who will do us proud. Welcome to the family.
</b></font></TD>
