            <TD><font size="3"><b>
<font size=14 color=red> 
			<br>
	
THE FROG IS DEAD!!!!!! 
			<br>
	
</font> 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Yah Yah I know.....Friday nights Froggie killing was premepted when someone found the frog going for a swim. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
We massed and after an unreal battle....the frog ran in fear till Bolvi hacked a leg off... we emerged victorious. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Special thanks to the people who joined with us.. spec Hikaru, Kerry, and Torquil from LoA. They were late additions but died bravely... well not Kerry she got smart and groveled and escaped. Kyshin and Bedind also fought bravely and Kyshin died ... well slowly...but fast...kinda...had to see it. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
GRATS KITIARAN ON YOUR EPIC MOB!!!!!!!!!! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Awsome guild grouping on an unannounced attack:) 
