6/13/01 The Remains Are Discovered 
			<br>
	
</font> 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Last night while enroute to the Tuesday night Coldain ring quest, a shout erupted in chat!!! The remains of Venril Sather had spawned. Of course this led to a logistical nightmare of redirecting our forces at a moments notice but with the help of poor Sree we were able to finally get everyone to Karnors. 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
The fight was surprisingly easy.. with three groups:) 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Congrats to Tuuvena and Torek on their epic pieces! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Later we were a few tanks and a couple of clerics shy of the BIG BAD FROG in the swamp so we rerouted and went after Seb Keys. Grats to Tuuvena and Canara.  
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Special thanks to Mothraz for not only ordering the forces away from the ring quest, but for also logging in his cleric to assist. We know how much that ring quest means to you:) 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
All in all a good night! 
			<br>
	
 
			<br>
	
Please check under raids and events to keep current with what is quickly becoming a hectic schedule. 
